{
 "1": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 410\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The five Vs of big data around a central circle, each with a meaning and an example\">\n          <g style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:2\">\n            <line x1=\"360\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"152\"/>\n            <line x1=\"222\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"190\"/>\n            <line x1=\"498\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"414\" y2=\"190\"/>\n            <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"244\"/>\n            <line x1=\"460\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"244\"/>\n          </g>\n          <circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"210\" r=\"58\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-ink)\">Big data</text>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-ink)\">the five Vs</text>\n          <rect x=\"255\" y=\"12\" width=\"210\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Volume</text>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">how much is stored</text>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">TB to PB of logs, video</text>\n          <rect x=\"498\" y=\"110\" width=\"210\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"603\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Velocity</text>\n          <text x=\"603\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">how fast it arrives</text>\n          <text x=\"603\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">UPI payments each second</text>\n          <rect x=\"460\" y=\"262\" width=\"210\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"565\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Variety</text>\n          <text x=\"565\" y=\"304\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">how many forms</text>\n          <text x=\"565\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">tables, JSON, text, images</text>\n          <rect x=\"50\" y=\"262\" width=\"210\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"155\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Veracity</text>\n          <text x=\"155\" y=\"304\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">how far to trust it</text>\n          <text x=\"155\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">bots, duplicates, noise</text>\n          <rect x=\"12\" y=\"110\" width=\"210\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"117\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Value</text>\n          <text x=\"117\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">what it is worth</text>\n          <text x=\"117\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">fraud caught, sales won</text>\n          <rect x=\"150\" y=\"355\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"174\" y=\"368\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">Laney’s three Vs (2001)</text>\n          <rect x=\"400\" y=\"355\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"424\" y=\"368\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">added later by industry</text>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"398\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">1 TB = 10¹² bytes · 1 PB = 10¹⁵ bytes · 1 EB = 10¹⁸ bytes · 1 ZB = 10²¹ bytes</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 6.1.1</b> The five Vs of big data, each with the question it answers and an example. The blue three are Laney’s original list; veracity and value were added later. Notice that only volume is about size: data can be “big” because it is fast or mixed even when it is not huge.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "2": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 434\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"HDFS architecture: a client, the NameNode with block metadata, a Secondary NameNode, and six DataNodes in two racks holding three replicas of each of four blocks\">\n          <defs><marker id=\"m621\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs>\n          <rect x=\"12\" y=\"22\" width=\"128\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"76\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Client</text>\n          <text x=\"76\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">outside cluster</text>\n          <rect x=\"210\" y=\"14\" width=\"330\" height=\"128\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"224\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"currentColor\">NameNode: metadata in RAM</text>\n          <text x=\"224\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">/data/sales.csv → B1, B2, B3, B4</text>\n          <text x=\"224\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">B1: DN1 DN5 DN6 · B2: DN4 DN2 DN3</text>\n          <text x=\"224\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">B3: DN3 DN4 DN5 · B4: DN6 DN1 DN2</text>\n          <text x=\"224\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">saved as fsimage + edit log</text>\n          <rect x=\"572\" y=\"22\" width=\"136\" height=\"90\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"640\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Secondary</text>\n          <text x=\"640\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">NameNode</text>\n          <text x=\"640\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">checkpoints</text>\n          <line x1=\"540\" y1=\"67\" x2=\"570\" y2=\"67\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m621)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"207\" y2=\"60\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m621)\"/>\n          <text x=\"146\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">① ask</text>\n          <line x1=\"73\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"73\" y2=\"225\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m621)\"/>\n          <text x=\"82\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">② write B1</text>\n          <g style=\"stroke:var(--muted);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:5 4\">\n            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"145\" marker-end=\"url(#m621)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"520\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"145\" marker-end=\"url(#m621)\"/>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">heartbeats every 3 s, block reports</text>\n          <rect x=\"12\" y=\"200\" width=\"340\" height=\"152\" rx=\"10\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:6 4\"/>\n          <rect x=\"368\" y=\"200\" width=\"340\" height=\"152\" rx=\"10\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:6 4\"/>\n          <text x=\"340\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">Rack 1</text>\n          <text x=\"696\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">Rack 2</text>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"24\" y=\"228\" width=\"98\" height=\"116\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"135\" y=\"228\" width=\"98\" height=\"116\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"246\" y=\"228\" width=\"98\" height=\"116\" rx=\"6\"/>\n            <rect x=\"380\" y=\"228\" width=\"98\" height=\"116\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"491\" y=\"228\" width=\"98\" height=\"116\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"602\" y=\"228\" width=\"98\" height=\"116\" rx=\"6\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"73\" y=\"248\">DN1</text><text x=\"184\" y=\"248\">DN2</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"248\">DN3</text>\n            <text x=\"429\" y=\"248\">DN4</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"248\">DN5</text><text x=\"651\" y=\"248\">DN6</text>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\">\n            <rect x=\"37\" y=\"258\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/><rect x=\"504\" y=\"302\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/><rect x=\"615\" y=\"258\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--bg);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"37\" y=\"302\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/><rect x=\"148\" y=\"258\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/><rect x=\"148\" y=\"302\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/>\n            <rect x=\"259\" y=\"258\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/><rect x=\"259\" y=\"302\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/><rect x=\"393\" y=\"258\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/>\n            <rect x=\"393\" y=\"302\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/><rect x=\"504\" y=\"258\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/><rect x=\"615\" y=\"302\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"73\" y=\"279\">B1</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"323\">B4</text><text x=\"184\" y=\"279\">B2</text><text x=\"184\" y=\"323\">B4</text>\n            <text x=\"295\" y=\"279\">B2</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"323\">B3</text><text x=\"429\" y=\"279\">B2</text><text x=\"429\" y=\"323\">B3</text>\n            <text x=\"540\" y=\"279\">B3</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"323\">B1</text><text x=\"651\" y=\"279\">B1</text><text x=\"651\" y=\"323\">B4</text>\n          </g>\n          <path d=\"M73,344 V378 H530 V347\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m621)\"/>\n          <path d=\"M552,344 V396 H660 V347\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m621)\"/>\n          <text x=\"300\" y=\"420\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">③ pipeline for B1: DN1 → DN5 → DN6; acks flow back</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 6.2.1</b> HDFS storing the 500 MB file of the worked example as blocks B1–B3 (128 MB each) and B4 (116 MB), three replicas each. The client gets metadata from the NameNode (①) but sends data straight to DataNodes (②), which pass it along a pipeline (③). Follow the blue B1: one copy in Rack 1, two in Rack 2, so it survives losing either rack.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "3": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 424\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"MapReduce word count data flow from two input splits through map, combine, shuffle and two reducers to two output files\">\n          <defs><marker id=\"m631\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"71\" y=\"26\">Input splits</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"26\">Map</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"26\">Combine</text>\n            <text x=\"390\" y=\"26\">Shuffle</text><text x=\"505\" y=\"26\">Reduce</text><text x=\"648\" y=\"26\">Output</text>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"12\" y=\"50\" width=\"118\" height=\"84\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"240\" width=\"118\" height=\"84\" rx=\"6\"/>\n            <rect x=\"148\" y=\"40\" width=\"88\" height=\"140\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"148\" y=\"230\" width=\"88\" height=\"116\" rx=\"6\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"252\" y=\"60\" width=\"88\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"252\" y=\"250\" width=\"88\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\"/>\n            <rect x=\"440\" y=\"70\" width=\"130\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"440\" y=\"230\" width=\"130\" height=\"100\" rx=\"6\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"588\" y=\"70\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"588\" y=\"230\" width=\"120\" height=\"100\" rx=\"6\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"71\" y=\"72\" font-weight=\"700\">Split 1</text><text x=\"71\" y=\"96\">upi pay upi</text><text x=\"71\" y=\"118\">cricket pay</text>\n            <text x=\"71\" y=\"262\" font-weight=\"700\">Split 2</text><text x=\"71\" y=\"286\">upi cricket</text><text x=\"71\" y=\"308\">pay upi</text>\n            <text x=\"192\" y=\"64\">upi, 1</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"88\">pay, 1</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"112\">upi, 1</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"136\">cricket, 1</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"160\">pay, 1</text>\n            <text x=\"192\" y=\"254\">upi, 1</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"278\">cricket, 1</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"302\">pay, 1</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"326\">upi, 1</text>\n            <text x=\"296\" y=\"86\">cricket, 1</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"110\">pay, 2</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"134\">upi, 2</text>\n            <text x=\"296\" y=\"276\">cricket, 1</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"300\">pay, 1</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"324\">upi, 2</text>\n            <text x=\"505\" y=\"94\" font-weight=\"700\">Reducer 0</text><text x=\"505\" y=\"122\">cricket [1, 1]</text>\n            <text x=\"505\" y=\"254\" font-weight=\"700\">Reducer 1</text><text x=\"505\" y=\"282\">pay [2, 1]</text><text x=\"505\" y=\"308\">upi [2, 2]</text>\n            <text x=\"648\" y=\"94\">part-r-00000</text><text x=\"648\" y=\"122\" font-weight=\"700\">cricket 2</text>\n            <text x=\"648\" y=\"254\">part-r-00001</text><text x=\"648\" y=\"282\" font-weight=\"700\">pay 3</text><text x=\"648\" y=\"308\" font-weight=\"700\">upi 4</text>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"stroke:var(--muted);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"146\" y2=\"92\" marker-end=\"url(#m631)\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"282\" x2=\"146\" y2=\"282\" marker-end=\"url(#m631)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"236\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"105\" marker-end=\"url(#m631)\"/><line x1=\"236\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"295\" marker-end=\"url(#m631)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"570\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"586\" y2=\"110\" marker-end=\"url(#m631)\"/><line x1=\"570\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"586\" y2=\"280\" marker-end=\"url(#m631)\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\">\n            <line x1=\"342\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"437\" y2=\"100\" marker-end=\"url(#m631)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"342\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"437\" y2=\"262\" marker-end=\"url(#m631)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"342\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"437\" y2=\"132\" marker-end=\"url(#m631)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"342\" y1=\"312\" x2=\"437\" y2=\"300\" marker-end=\"url(#m631)\"/>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"380\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Partitioner: words a–m → Reducer 0; words n–z → Reducer 1</text>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"406\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Pairs sent over the network: 9 without the combiner, 6 with it</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 6.3.1</b> Word count on four short lines, with two map tasks and two reducers. Each mapper emits (word, 1); its combiner adds locally; the shuffle (blue lines) sends every pair for one word to the same reducer, which adds the values and writes one output file. Notice that the lines cross: every mapper talks to every reducer.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "4": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 384\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"YARN architecture: a client submits to the ResourceManager, which launches an ApplicationMaster on a NodeManager; the ApplicationMaster requests containers and starts tasks on other NodeManagers\">\n          <defs><marker id=\"m641\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs>\n          <rect x=\"12\" y=\"30\" width=\"120\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"72\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Client</text>\n          <text x=\"72\" y=\"76\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">submits job</text>\n          <rect x=\"200\" y=\"12\" width=\"340\" height=\"110\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"370\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">ResourceManager (master)</text>\n          <rect x=\"214\" y=\"48\" width=\"152\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n          <rect x=\"380\" y=\"48\" width=\"146\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n          <text x=\"290\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Scheduler</text>\n          <text x=\"290\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">allots resources</text>\n          <text x=\"453\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Applications</text>\n          <text x=\"453\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Manager</text>\n          <line x1=\"132\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"197\" y2=\"60\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m641)\"/>\n          <text x=\"138\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">①</text>\n          <text x=\"222\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">③ request / grant</text>\n          <g style=\"stroke:var(--muted);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:5 4\">\n            <line x1=\"420\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"468\" y2=\"125\" marker-end=\"url(#m641)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"600\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"522\" y2=\"125\" marker-end=\"url(#m641)\"/>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"582\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">heartbeats</text>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"12\" y=\"200\" width=\"224\" height=\"98\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"248\" y=\"200\" width=\"224\" height=\"98\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"484\" y=\"200\" width=\"224\" height=\"98\" rx=\"8\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"124\" y=\"222\">NodeManager 1</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"222\">NodeManager 2</text><text x=\"596\" y=\"222\">NodeManager 3</text>\n          </g>\n          <rect x=\"130\" y=\"236\" width=\"96\" height=\"44\" rx=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"22\" y=\"236\" width=\"96\" height=\"44\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"258\" y=\"236\" width=\"96\" height=\"44\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"366\" y=\"236\" width=\"96\" height=\"44\" rx=\"5\"/>\n            <rect x=\"494\" y=\"236\" width=\"96\" height=\"44\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"602\" y=\"236\" width=\"96\" height=\"44\" rx=\"5\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"70\" y=\"263\">map 1</text><text x=\"178\" y=\"263\" font-weight=\"700\">App Master</text><text x=\"306\" y=\"263\">map 2</text>\n            <text x=\"414\" y=\"263\">map 3</text><text x=\"542\" y=\"263\">map 4</text><text x=\"650\" y=\"263\">reduce 1</text>\n          </g>\n          <line x1=\"440\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"218\" y2=\"233\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m641)\"/>\n          <text x=\"324\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">② launch AM</text>\n          <line x1=\"188\" y1=\"234\" x2=\"262\" y2=\"111\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\" marker-start=\"url(#m641)\" marker-end=\"url(#m641)\"/>\n          <path d=\"M178,280 V336 H650 V301\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m641)\"/>\n          <path d=\"M360,336 V301\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m641)\"/>\n          <text x=\"400\" y=\"366\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">④ the AM asks each NodeManager to start its tasks in containers</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 6.4.1</b> YARN running one MapReduce job. ① the client submits; ② the ApplicationsManager launches the job’s ApplicationMaster (orange) in a container on NodeManager 1; ③ the AM requests containers and the Scheduler grants them; ④ the AM has the NodeManagers start map and reduce tasks (green containers). NodeManagers report free resources by heartbeat. Notice that the RM never runs a task itself.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "5": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The same student record stored in the four NoSQL data models: key-value, document, column family and graph\">\n          <defs><marker id=\"m651\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"12\" y=\"12\" width=\"344\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\"/><rect x=\"364\" y=\"12\" width=\"344\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\"/>\n            <rect x=\"12\" y=\"206\" width=\"344\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\"/><rect x=\"364\" y=\"206\" width=\"344\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"26\" y=\"36\">Key–value · Redis, DynamoDB</text><text x=\"378\" y=\"36\">Document · MongoDB</text>\n            <text x=\"26\" y=\"230\">Column family · HBase, Cassandra</text><text x=\"378\" y=\"230\">Graph · Neo4j</text>\n          </g>\n          <rect x=\"28\" y=\"80\" width=\"122\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n          <text x=\"89\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">student:R101</text>\n          <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"176\" y2=\"100\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);stroke-width:1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#m651)\"/>\n          <rect x=\"178\" y=\"64\" width=\"162\" height=\"72\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--bg);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n          <text x=\"259\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Asha|CSE|88|92</text>\n          <text x=\"259\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">opaque bytes</text>\n          <text x=\"26\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">only get(key) and put(key, value)</text>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-family:var(--mono)\">\n            <text x=\"380\" y=\"64\">{ \"_id\": \"R101\",</text><text x=\"396\" y=\"86\">\"name\": \"Asha\", \"dept\": \"CSE\",</text>\n            <text x=\"396\" y=\"108\">\"marks\": { \"DS\": 88, \"ML\": 92 },</text><text x=\"396\" y=\"130\">\"clubs\": [\"NSS\", \"Music\"] }</text>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"378\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">query any field; nest instead of join</text>\n          <rect x=\"24\" y=\"244\" width=\"320\" height=\"88\" style=\"fill:var(--bg);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1\"/>\n          <g style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1\">\n            <line x1=\"94\" y1=\"244\" x2=\"94\" y2=\"332\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"332\"/><line x1=\"218\" y1=\"244\" x2=\"218\" y2=\"332\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"332\"/>\n            <line x1=\"94\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"344\" y2=\"266\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"344\" y2=\"288\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"310\" x2=\"344\" y2=\"310\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"59\" y=\"282\" font-weight=\"700\">row key</text><text x=\"156\" y=\"260\" font-weight=\"700\">info</text><text x=\"281\" y=\"260\" font-weight=\"700\">marks</text>\n            <text x=\"125\" y=\"282\">name</text><text x=\"187\" y=\"282\">dept</text><text x=\"249\" y=\"282\">DS</text><text x=\"312\" y=\"282\">ML</text>\n            <text x=\"59\" y=\"304\">R101</text><text x=\"125\" y=\"304\">Asha</text><text x=\"187\" y=\"304\">CSE</text><text x=\"249\" y=\"304\">88</text><text x=\"312\" y=\"304\">92</text>\n            <text x=\"59\" y=\"326\">R102</text><text x=\"125\" y=\"326\">Ravi</text><text x=\"187\" y=\"326\">ECE</text><text x=\"249\" y=\"326\">75</text>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"26\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">families fixed; columns vary per row</text>\n          <line x1=\"470\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"604\" y2=\"262\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m651)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"470\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"604\" y2=\"334\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <circle cx=\"444\" cy=\"296\" r=\"30\"/><circle cx=\"634\" cy=\"256\" r=\"30\"/><circle cx=\"634\" cy=\"338\" r=\"30\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"444\" y=\"301\">Asha</text><text x=\"634\" y=\"261\">DS101</text><text x=\"634\" y=\"343\">Ravi</text>\n            <text x=\"532\" y=\"262\">ENROLLED 88</text><text x=\"532\" y=\"338\">FRIEND</text>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"378\" y=\"378\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">follow relationships in one hop</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 6.5.1</b> One student stored four ways. The key–value store sees only a key and a blob; the document store understands nested fields; the column-family store keeps sparse rows grouped into families (R102 has no ML mark, and the empty cell costs nothing); the graph store keeps relationships as first-class edges.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "6": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 336\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Spark DAG for word count: two partitions flow through textFile, flatMap and map in stage 1, then a shuffle to reduceByKey in stage 2, then collect to the driver\">\n          <defs><marker id=\"m661\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs>\n          <rect x=\"12\" y=\"38\" width=\"428\" height=\"212\" rx=\"10\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:6 4\"/>\n          <rect x=\"470\" y=\"38\" width=\"238\" height=\"212\" rx=\"10\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:6 4\"/>\n          <text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"currentColor\">Stage 1: narrow steps, 2 tasks</text>\n          <text x=\"482\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"currentColor\">Stage 2: 2 tasks</text>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"86\" y=\"64\">textFile()</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"64\">flatMap()</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"64\">map()</text>\n            <text x=\"537\" y=\"64\">reduceByKey()</text><text x=\"652\" y=\"64\">collect()</text>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"24\" y=\"80\" width=\"124\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"166\" width=\"124\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\"/>\n            <rect x=\"166\" y=\"80\" width=\"124\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"166\" y=\"166\" width=\"124\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\"/>\n            <rect x=\"308\" y=\"80\" width=\"120\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"308\" y=\"166\" width=\"120\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"482\" y=\"80\" width=\"110\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"482\" y=\"166\" width=\"110\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\"/>\n          </g>\n          <rect x=\"606\" y=\"80\" width=\"94\" height=\"156\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"86\" y=\"108\">upi pay upi</text><text x=\"86\" y=\"130\">cricket pay</text>\n            <text x=\"86\" y=\"194\">upi cricket</text><text x=\"86\" y=\"216\">pay upi</text>\n            <text x=\"228\" y=\"108\">upi, pay, upi,</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"130\">cricket, pay</text>\n            <text x=\"228\" y=\"194\">upi, cricket,</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"216\">pay, upi</text>\n            <text x=\"368\" y=\"120\">5 × (word, 1)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"206\">4 × (word, 1)</text>\n            <text x=\"537\" y=\"120\">(cricket, 2)</text><text x=\"537\" y=\"194\">(pay, 3)</text><text x=\"537\" y=\"216\">(upi, 4)</text>\n            <text x=\"653\" y=\"114\">driver</text><text x=\"653\" y=\"146\">cricket 2</text><text x=\"653\" y=\"168\">pay 3</text><text x=\"653\" y=\"190\">upi 4</text>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"stroke:var(--muted);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <line x1=\"148\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"115\" marker-end=\"url(#m661)\"/><line x1=\"148\" y1=\"201\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"201\" marker-end=\"url(#m661)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"115\" marker-end=\"url(#m661)\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"201\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"201\" marker-end=\"url(#m661)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"592\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"604\" y2=\"115\" marker-end=\"url(#m661)\"/><line x1=\"592\" y1=\"201\" x2=\"604\" y2=\"201\" marker-end=\"url(#m661)\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\">\n            <line x1=\"428\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"108\" marker-end=\"url(#m661)\"/><line x1=\"428\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"190\" marker-end=\"url(#m661)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"428\" y1=\"194\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"128\" marker-end=\"url(#m661)\"/><line x1=\"428\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"210\" marker-end=\"url(#m661)\"/>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"455\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">shuffle</text>\n          <text x=\"24\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">Narrow: each partition feeds one partition, no data moves (grey arrows).</text>\n          <text x=\"24\" y=\"322\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">Wide: reduceByKey shuffles across the network (orange) and starts a new stage.</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 6.6.1</b> The DAG Spark builds for the word count above. The three narrow steps run together as one task per partition in stage 1; the shuffle for reduceByKey begins stage 2; collect() brings the result to the driver. Which key lands in which partition depends on the hash of the key. Nothing in the figure runs until collect() is called.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "7": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Star schema with a Fact_Sales table in the centre linked to Date, Store, Product and Customer dimension tables\">\n          <g style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:2\">\n            <line x1=\"212\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"150\"/><line x1=\"508\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"150\"/>\n            <line x1=\"212\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"262\"/><line x1=\"508\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"262\"/>\n          </g>\n          <rect x=\"250\" y=\"120\" width=\"220\" height=\"172\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"250\" y=\"120\" width=\"220\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"141\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-ink)\">Fact_Sales</text>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"264\" y=\"172\">date_key (FK)</text><text x=\"264\" y=\"194\">store_key (FK)</text><text x=\"264\" y=\"216\">product_key (FK)</text>\n            <text x=\"264\" y=\"238\">customer_key (FK)</text><text x=\"264\" y=\"260\" font-weight=\"700\">quantity</text><text x=\"264\" y=\"282\" font-weight=\"700\">amount_rs</text>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\">\n            <rect x=\"12\" y=\"12\" width=\"200\" height=\"116\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"508\" y=\"12\" width=\"200\" height=\"116\" rx=\"8\"/>\n            <rect x=\"12\" y=\"272\" width=\"200\" height=\"116\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"508\" y=\"272\" width=\"200\" height=\"116\" rx=\"8\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\">\n            <rect x=\"12\" y=\"12\" width=\"200\" height=\"28\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"508\" y=\"12\" width=\"200\" height=\"28\" rx=\"8\"/>\n            <rect x=\"12\" y=\"272\" width=\"200\" height=\"28\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"508\" y=\"272\" width=\"200\" height=\"28\" rx=\"8\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"112\" y=\"32\">Dim_Date</text><text x=\"608\" y=\"32\">Dim_Store</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"292\">Dim_Product</text><text x=\"608\" y=\"292\">Dim_Customer</text>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"26\" y=\"64\">date_key (PK)</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"86\">date, month</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"108\">quarter, year</text>\n            <text x=\"522\" y=\"64\">store_key (PK)</text><text x=\"522\" y=\"86\">city, state</text><text x=\"522\" y=\"108\">region, floor area</text>\n            <text x=\"26\" y=\"324\">product_key (PK)</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"346\">name, brand</text><text x=\"26\" y=\"368\">category</text>\n            <text x=\"522\" y=\"324\">customer_key (PK)</text><text x=\"522\" y=\"346\">age band, gender</text><text x=\"522\" y=\"368\">PIN code</text>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"360\" y=\"320\">grain: one bill line</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"342\">measures in bold</text>\n          </g>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 6.7.1</b> A star schema for a retail chain. The fact table in the centre holds only keys and measures; each dimension around it holds the words you filter and group by. A query such as “phone sales by state in Q1” joins the fact table to three dimensions, one join each. In a snowflake schema, city and state would move into their own tables.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "8": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Defence in depth: nested layers of perimeter, authentication, authorization, encryption and privacy protection around the data, with governance alongside\">\n          <rect x=\"12\" y=\"12\" width=\"508\" height=\"356\" rx=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"36\" y=\"48\" width=\"460\" height=\"296\" rx=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--bg);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"60\" y=\"84\" width=\"412\" height=\"236\" rx=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"84\" y=\"120\" width=\"364\" height=\"176\" rx=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"108\" y=\"156\" width=\"316\" height=\"116\" rx=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"150\" y=\"194\" width=\"232\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"266\" y=\"36\" font-weight=\"700\">Perimeter: firewall, Knox gateway</text>\n            <text x=\"266\" y=\"72\" font-weight=\"700\">Authentication: Kerberos (who are you?)</text>\n            <text x=\"266\" y=\"108\" font-weight=\"700\">Authorization: ACLs, Ranger (what may you do?)</text>\n            <text x=\"266\" y=\"144\" font-weight=\"700\">Encryption: TLS in transit, zones at rest</text>\n            <text x=\"266\" y=\"180\" font-weight=\"700\">Masking, tokens, k-anonymity</text>\n            <text x=\"266\" y=\"222\" font-weight=\"700\">Data: HDFS, Hive, HBase</text>\n            <text x=\"266\" y=\"244\">personal data inside</text>\n          </g>\n          <rect x=\"540\" y=\"12\" width=\"168\" height=\"356\" rx=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n            <text x=\"624\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">Governance</text>\n            <text x=\"624\" y=\"76\">owners, stewards</text><text x=\"624\" y=\"104\">classification</text><text x=\"624\" y=\"132\">catalogue, lineage</text>\n            <text x=\"624\" y=\"160\">quality checks</text><text x=\"624\" y=\"188\">retention, deletion</text><text x=\"624\" y=\"216\">audit logs</text>\n            <text x=\"624\" y=\"260\" font-weight=\"700\">Law</text><text x=\"624\" y=\"288\">DPDP Act 2023</text><text x=\"624\" y=\"316\">GDPR</text><text x=\"624\" y=\"344\">consent, purpose</text>\n          </g>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 6.8.1</b> Defence in depth around a big data platform. An attacker must pass every layer to reach readable personal data, and the inner layer (masking, tokens, anonymisation) protects people even from authorised analysts. Governance and the law, on the right, decide who owns the data and what each layer must enforce.</figcaption>\n      </figure>"
}